target.value:
E-government framework is in place to guide all provinces and government authorities to implement e-government services
 Commontechnical and application standards for e-government are issued such as email integrated system; 
 A number of laws, decree andcircular issued by MIC to guide business, citizens, gov agencies to implement including:
- 02 Laws (Postal Law and Law of RadioFrequency) + 01 draft of Law of Information Security
- 01 Decree of the Government about Managing of Investments on Applications ofInformation Technology;
- 01 Decision of  the Prime Minister about the national planning of information security;
- 01Directives ofthe Prime Minister about strengthening the implementation of information securing activities
- 10 Circulars of Ministry ofInformation and Communications about the application of information technology;
- 02 Decrees of MIC about the application ofinformation technology and information security;
- Several Decisions on national standards on information security;
- 02 Guidelineson application of information technology.

actual.value:
+ TA on e-government Framework and IT applications standard is under implementation.
+ The integrated email system documents arefinalized and being in use to develop feasible study of e-mail national system project belong to the national program of ITdevelopment. 
+ Supporting to promulgate a number of laws, decree and circular issued by MIC to guide business, citizens, govagencies to implement including:
- 02 Laws (Postal Law and Law of Radio Frequency) + 01 draft of Law of Information Security
- 01Decree of the Government about Managing of Investments on Applications of Information Technology;
- 01 Decision of  the PrimeMinister about the national planning of information security;
- 01 Directives of the Prime Minister about strengthening theimplementation of information securing activities
- 10 Circulars of Ministry of Information and Communications about theapplication of information technology;
- 02Decrees of MIC about the application of information technology and informationsecurity;
- Several Decisions on national standards on information security;
- 02 Guidelines on application of informationtechnology.

